; Deer — model scene for AnimalDefinition.model_scenes.
; Source: Quaternius "Ultimate Animated Animal Pack" (July 2021), CC0 1.0 — same pack as
; Fox; see project/attribution/sources/quaternius_ultimate_animated_animals.tres.
;
; Design role: decided substitute for the Monkey gap (art.md → Newly Available Animals /
; Desired Roster Assets — Still Missing) as well as a first-class roster candidate in its
; own right (art.md → Newly Available Animals: open_grass, forest · Shy).
;
; Audit (2026-07-26): 13 animation clips confirmed on the raw glTF — Idle, Idle_2,
; Idle_Headlow, Idle_HitReact1/2, Walk, Gallop, Gallop_Jump, Jump_toIdle, Eating,
; Attack_Headbutt, Attack_Kick, Death. Idle/Walk (the hard requirement) both present and
; non-degenerate (48 tracks each). Node structure matches Fox exactly (AnimalArmature ->
; Skeleton3D -> mesh, AnimationPlayer as sibling index 1), so the wrapper shape below is
; the same as Fox.tscn's.
;
; Scale: 0.2, matching Fox's already-established factor for this exact pack — same
; creator, same Blender export convention, so reusing Fox's factor preserves the
; modeler's own relative sizing between pack-mates rather than inventing a new per-species
; number. Raw AABB height 4.274 -> scaled height 0.855 (a little under person-scale
; height, believable for a deer). FLAG FOR HUMAN REVIEW: not yet eyeball-confirmed in
; engine against Fox/Rabbit/Human at the same table.
